    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HopsStarter_Name","source":"Hops Starter","translation":"啤酒花種植包"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HopsStarter_Description","source":"Plant these in the summer. Takes 11 days to grow, but keeps producing after that. Grows on a trellis.","translation":"夏季播種，十一天成熟，之後持續收成。依附棚架生長。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HorseFlute_Name","source":"Horse Flute","translation":"馬笛"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HorseFlute_Description","source":"Playing this flute will summon your horse. Only works outdoors.","translation":"吹奏後可召喚你的馬。只能在戶外使用。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HotJavaRing_Name","source":"Hot Java Ring","translation":"熱咖啡戒指"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HotJavaRing_Description","source":"Greatly increases your chance to find coffee drinks when slaying monsters.","translation":"消滅怪物時，大幅提高找到咖啡飲品的機率。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HotPepper_Name","source":"Hot Pepper","translation":"辣椒"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HotPepper_Description","source":"Fiery hot with a hint of sweetness.","translation":"辛辣如火，又帶一絲甜味。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HyperSpeedGro_Name","source":"Hyper Speed-Gro","translation":"超級速生肥"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"HyperSpeedGro_Description","source":"Greatly stimulates leaf production. Guaranteed to increase growth rate by at least 33%. Mix into tilled soil.","translation":"大幅刺激葉片生長，保證將生長速度提高至少33%。混入耕作過的土壤。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"IceCream_Name","source":"Ice Cream","translation":"冰淇淋"},
