    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"Jamborite_Name","source":"Jamborite","translation":"詹博礦"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"Jamborite_Description","source":"The crystals are so tightly packed it almost looks fuzzy.","translation":"晶體排列得極其緊密，看來幾乎毛茸茸的。"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"Jasper_Name","source":"Jasper","translation":"碧玉"},
    {"target":"Strings/Objects","key":"Jasper_Description","source":"When polished, this stone becomes attractively luminous. Prized by ancient peoples for thousands of years.","translation":"拋光後會散發迷人光澤，數千年來一直受到古人珍視。"}
  ]
